@startuml
title UML state machine diagram for Process Sale

state "WaitingForSale" as WaitingForSale
WaitingForSale : entry/Wait for new sale
WaitingForSale : do/Waits for a customer

state "AddingItems" as AddingItems
AddingItems : entry/Add items one by one
AddingItems : do/Add selected items

state "PaymentProcessing" as PaymentProcessing
PaymentProcessing : entry/Process payment
PaymentProcessing : do/Verify payment details

state "SaleCompleted" as SaleCompleted
SaleCompleted : entry/Sale is completed
SaleCompleted : do/Return to waiting for next customer

[*] --> WaitingForSale

WaitingForSale --> AddingItems : NewSale

AddingItems --> PaymentProcessing : AllItemsAdded

PaymentProcessing --> SaleCompleted : CashPayment
PaymentProcessing --> SaleCompleted : PaymentApproved

SaleCompleted --> [*]

@enduml
